<Layout title="Privacy" description="How this static Butser IX Legion website handles privacy."><section class="page-heading"><div><h1>Privacy</h1><p class="lead">No advertising, tracking scripts or contact forms.</p></div></section><article class="prose section-wrap privacy-copy"><h2>Browsing this site</h2><p>This website does not set its own cookies or use analytics. Images and fonts are served with the site. GitHub Pages, our hosting provider, may process technical information such as IP addresses to operate and secure the service. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>.</p><h2>Getting in touch</h2><p>Email links open your own email application. Anything you send is handled through the Legion’s email service, rather than collected by this website. Please only include the information needed for your enquiry.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Venue websites have their own privacy arrangements. No external maps, social feeds or videos are loaded automatically here.</p></article></Layout>
